WEBVTT

setup-01
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:05.762
Maya creates Riverbend Fantasy Six, with six participant seats.

setup-02
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.318
Maya invites five fantasy participants. Participants make the picks; athletes are drafted onto their rosters.

setup-03
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.021
An invitation alone does not grant approval.

setup-04-jordan
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.680
Jordan accepts.

setup-04-casey
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.332
Casey accepts.

setup-04-sam
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.749
Sam accepts.

setup-04-taylor
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:27.232
Taylor accepts.

setup-04-alex
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.580
Alex accepts.

setup-05
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:36.033
Maya approves each accepted participant. All six fantasy seats are now approved.

setup-06
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.398
She selects Riverbend Open, sets a thirty-second pick clock, and prepares the draft.

setup-07
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.734
The opening order is saved. Maya starts.

setup-08
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:50.222
Six participants draft athletes across four snake rounds.
